{"publicId":"a33dbe7f-9317-48d8-957c-25ba7d116bac","title":"Science Tokyo开发水下固化聚合物粘合玻璃并验证强度","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T18:20:11.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T18:20:11.000Z","digest":"Science Tokyo在Angewandte Chemie发表论文，开发出遇水固化且能粘合破碎玻璃容器的聚合物。该材料24小时内实现95% silatrane基团参与反应，水下粘合实验测得剪切强度0.7–1.6 MPa，但固化后仍保持脆性。研究团队称其突破传统水下粘合剂需干燥环境限制，目前仅公布实验数据，未提及长期稳定性或实际应用场景。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T18:59:35.593Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Science Tokyo 研究团队在 Angewandte Chemie 发表新型水下固化聚合物论文","latestReport":{"id":"mpxnqrukijwhrv5quly5r15cw"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fy9gIJe-ZeAw","title":"研究团队开发了一种水激活的聚合物，可以在水下形成固体形状并粘合玻璃碎片","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T18:20:11.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mpxnqrukijwhrv5quly5r15cw","title":"Science Tokyo 研究团队在 Angewandte Chemie 发表新型水下固化聚合物论文","summary":"Science Tokyo 研究团队在 Angewandte Chemie 发表论文，开发出新型水激活聚合物。该材料遇水可从粘稠状逐渐固化成固体，并成功粘合破碎玻璃容器，24 小时内 95% 的 silatrane 基团参与反应，初步验证水下成型与粘合能力。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T18:20:11.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mpxnqrukijwhrv5quly5r15cw","title":"Science Tokyo 研究团队在 Angewandte Chemie 发表新型水下固化聚合物论文","summary":"Science Tokyo 研究团队在 Angewandte Chemie 发表论文，开发出新型水激活聚合物。该材料遇水可从粘稠状逐渐固化成固体，并成功粘合破碎玻璃容器，24 小时内 95% 的 silatrane 基团参与反应，初步验证水下成型与粘合能力。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T18:20:11.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T04:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"20